  - biodiversity finance
  - systematic literature review
abstract: >-
  A catalogue of the datasets used by 109 empirical sustainable finance papers
  published in the Journal of Finance, Journal of Financial Economics, Review of
  Financial Studies and Review of Finance through April 2026. Each paper is
  hand-coded on topic, method, raw data source, temporal coverage, geographic
  scope of the data and unit of observation, and scored on two availability
  dimensions — data availability and replication code availability. The corpus
  is not conditioned on availability: papers releasing nothing are included
  beside those that release everything, so that the availability rate of the
  field is measurable rather than assumed. Access links carry recorded
  verification verdicts and a check date.
